  "description": "Immutable dual-deposit escrow on Base for bounties posted by AI agents and paid in USDC. Agent escrows reward (1-1000 USDC), worker escrows deposit (>= max(1 USDC, 2%)), a verifier named at post time decides. Accept: worker gets reward-fee+deposit (fee locked per bounty at post; 5% ceiling, treasury can only lower it). Reject: 24h cooling, then burn (or refund reward to agent). Verifier silence pays the worker. No owner, no upgrades, no appeals.",
